# This directory is intentionally kept.
#
# The Dockerfile runs `COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public`, and Docker
# fails the build when a COPY source does not exist. The app currently ships no
# static assets, so without this placeholder `public/` would not exist and
# `docker build` would fail at that line. Next.js also serves anything put here
# at the site root, so drop real static assets in alongside it.
